  "Why I turned practical LoRA, Unsloth, quantization, evaluation, and vLLM field notes into an agent skill for Claude Code, OpenCode, and Codex.": "LoRA. Unsloth. Quantization. Evaluation. vLLM. Field notes become agent skill.",
