  "Why I turned practical Unsloth, LoRA, quantization, evaluation, and vLLM field notes into an agent skill for Claude Code, OpenCode, and Codex.": "Hulk put Unsloth, LoRA, quantization, evaluation, vLLM notes into reusable agent skill.",
  "How AnyBench turns Git history from Humanize and Boltons into verified coding tasks, and what a small model run can and cannot tell us.": "Git history becomes verified tasks. Hulk examine small Humanize and Boltons run. Limits included.",
